event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch_dev_1.md\", \"content\": \"This is your task for the \\\"greet, tested\\\" mission. Implement exactly this, in\\nyour clone of the subject repository:\\n\\n1. Create `src/greet.py` with a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (substituting the given name in place of `\u003cname\u003e`).\\n\\n2. Create `tests/test_greet.py` with unit tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. greet(\\\"World\\\") == \\\"Hello, World!\\\")\\n   - the empty string (greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\")\\n\\n3. Verify locally that `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0 from\\n   the repository root.\\n\\n4. Commit your work to your own branch (do not amend/rewrite existing\\n   history — just add a normal commit).\\n\\n5. Reply honestly: state what you implemented, the exact command you ran to\\n   verify the tests, and its exit code/output.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

